  -attach
    	Attach to the session after starting (requires an interactive terminal)
  -json
    	Output as JSON
  -m string
    	Initial message to send once agent is ready (short)
  -message string
    	Initial message to send once agent is ready
  -message-file string
    	Read the initial message from a file ('-' for stdin); avoids shell quoting of long prompts
  -no-wait
    	Return as soon as the process is spawned instead of waiting up to 3s for the tool's session id (a caller that attaches right away; the id is still captured by hooks)
  -q	Minimal output (short)
  -quiet
    	Minimal output
  -yolo
    	Enable YOLO mode when starting Gemini or Codex sessions
